Package: giottoingest
Title: Rust Ingest Backend for GiottoDisk Stores
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Ruben", "Dries", , "rdries@bu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prototype Rust passes for writing GiottoDisk tile stores: the
    extent and per-tile counts that drive GiottoDisk's quadtree tile plan,
    and a single routed pass that writes every tile, reproducing the R
    writer's tiles, rows and column types.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.70.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    methods,
    tilework
Suggests:
    arrow,
    GiottoDisk,
